@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@learnreserve.local
@adminPassword = DemoAdmin!2026
@learnerEmail = learner@learnreserve.local
@learnerPassword = DemoLearner!2026
@resourceId = 1
@bookingId = 1
# Replace dates with future timestamps inside a published window.
@startsAt = 2030-01-02T10:00:00Z
@endsAt = 2030-01-02T11:00:00Z

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Discover resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources?type=STUDY_ROOM&page=0&size=20

### Register a learner (use a new email for repeated runs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Reviewer","email":"reviewer@example.com","password":"ReviewerPassword!2026"}

### Current account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Basic {{learnerEmail}} {{learnerPassword}}

### Create resource (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Interview Room","description":"A quiet space for interview practice","type":"STUDY_ROOM","location":"Library, floor 1"}

### Publish availability (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources/{{resourceId}}/availability
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"startsAt":"{{startsAt}}","endsAt":"{{endsAt}}"}

### Discover free intervals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources/{{resourceId}}/availability?from={{startsAt}}&to={{endsAt}}

### Book; repeat to receive 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Basic {{learnerEmail}} {{learnerPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"resourceId":{{resourceId}},"startsAt":"{{startsAt}}","endsAt":"{{endsAt}}"}

### My history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Basic {{learnerEmail}} {{learnerPassword}}

### Cancel; repeating this is idempotent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Basic {{learnerEmail}} {{learnerPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Deactivate (admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resources/{{resourceId}}/active
Authorization: Basic {{adminEmail}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"active":false}
